          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十一章 细胞工程技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.832,
            0.054,
            0.867,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "193"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.089,
            0.898,
            0.151
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "0.1%荧光增白剂，在荧光显微镜下以366nm的紫外线照射细胞壁部位发出绿色荧光。培养2周后，可能发展成细胞团。这时应向培养物添加等量新鲜培养基（渗透压减半），以促进细胞团增殖。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.154,
            0.9,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）细胞融合观察:培养 24h 后，可在倒置显微镜下，观察到融合的异核体。为了进一步证实是异核细胞，可用改良苯酚品红，对融合产物进行染色，因为不同植物的细胞核染色程度不同。根据颜色特征可统计异源融合频率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.225,
            0.207,
            0.249
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.26,
            0.521,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）观察记录两种原生质体的粘连情况。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.282,
            0.419,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 观察统计异源融合频率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.811,
            0.326,
            0.897,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(何炎明)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.316,
            0.382,
            0.698,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 63 单克隆抗体的制备"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.414,
            0.262,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.448,
            0.501,
            0.468
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "熟悉和掌握单克隆抗体的制备的技术。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.478,
            0.263,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.513,
            0.901,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1975 年，Kohler 和 Milstein 报道了将分泌抗体的小鼠脾细胞与小鼠骨髓瘤细胞成功融合的实验结果，融合细胞兼具骨髓瘤细胞的生长特性与脾细胞产生抗体的能力。经过不断发展，单克隆抗体技术已经广泛应用于各种研究领域以及实验诊断技术中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.586,
            0.427,
            0.609
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.62,
            0.901,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:超净工作台、小型台式离心机、液氮储存罐、37℃水浴锅、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 恒温培养箱、倒置显微镜、24孔培养板、96孔培养板、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25cm^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 细胞培养瓶、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "80cm^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 细胞培养瓶、冻存管、10ml移液管、培养皿、V形底30ml管、连续可调式移液器、无菌枪头、Hamilton 500μl路厄氏注射器、无菌镊子、剪刀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.707,
            0.673,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:P3X63Ag8.653 骨髓瘤细胞（无支原体污染）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.728,
            0.25,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.749,
            0.432,
            0.767
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1) RPMI 1640 (10×500ml)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.771,
            0.793,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）PSG×100（青霉素 10 000U/链霉素 10 000μg、L-谷氨酸 29.2mg）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.793,
            0.901,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）HAT×100（10mmol/L次黄嘌呤钠盐、40μmol/L氨基蝶呤、1.6mmol/L脱氧胸苷）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.836,
            0.736,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）HT×100（10mmol/L钠-次黄嘌呤、1.6mmol/L脱氧胸苷）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.857,
            0.585,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）胎牛血清（需选择杂交瘤专用级别的型号）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.878,
            0.641,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）弗氏完全佐剂（CFA）与不完全弗氏佐剂（IFA）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
