            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.826,
            0.057,
            0.862,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "195"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.1,
            0.383,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）抗原准备与免疫"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.134,
            0.895,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "需要注意的是，对以下两类抗原，经免疫的小鼠可能无法正常产生抗体:与小鼠自身成分高度相似的抗体；小分子抗原物质。因此小分子抗原通常与一个载体（carrier）蛋白结合才可被动物免疫系统识别（半抗原-载体蛋白）。选择载体蛋白种类时，需要考虑兰斯泰讷氏（Landsteiner's）法则，即半抗原的抗原决定簇基团应尽量远离载体蛋白。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.22,
            0.897,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "常用的载体蛋白包括钥孔（蛾）血蓝蛋白（KLH）和牛血清白蛋白（BSA）。如果采用 ELISA 检测单克隆抗体，则应从 KLH 与 BSA 中选择一种作为载体用于免疫，而选择另一种蛋白质用于检测抗体的特异性。将肽链结合到载体蛋白的方案取决于多肽的氨基酸序列与抗原决定簇的特征。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.306,
            0.895,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "如制备高亲和的 IgG 单克隆抗体，则需 T 细胞辅助的免疫机制参与，应采用佐剂以及一些免疫加强措施。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.349,
            0.897,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "常用的蛋白质抗原免疫流程见表11-3。抗原通常与佐剂一起进行免疫注射，完全弗氏佐剂（CFA）效率高但毒副作用较大。CFA只在第一次皮下注射时使用，加强注射时应使用不完全弗氏佐剂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.442,
            0.893,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_caption",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.34,
                0.424,
                0.667,
                0.44
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "表 11-3 应用于蛋白质抗原的免疫时间表"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.442,
                0.893,
                0.56
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_table_8.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>初次免疫</td><td>第0天</td></tr><tr><td>第一次加强</td><td>第14天</td></tr><tr><td>第二次加强</td><td>第28天</td></tr><tr><td>血清抗体检测</td><td>第35天</td></tr><tr><td>第三次加强</td><td>第42天</td></tr><tr><td>进入融合步骤</td><td>第45天</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.571,
            0.897,
            0.611
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "CFA 可诱发小鼠的炎症反应与肉芽肿，并对人体造成严重伤害，需谨慎使用，特别避免接触眼睛与伤口。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.615,
            0.898,
            0.677
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "由于融合使用的骨髓瘤细胞来自BALB/c系小鼠，因此免疫首选动物是6周龄大的雌性BALB/c小鼠。通常选用6只小鼠进行免疫，以2只为一组，按时间顺序进行分组注射——每组之间的注射时间间隔为2周。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.691,
            0.27,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）免疫"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.725,
            0.377,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "操作时须佩戴护目用具。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.748,
            0.862,
            0.767
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 将等体积的抗原溶液与 CFA 分别吸入 Hamilton "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 玻璃路厄氏注射器。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.769,
            0.704,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 将两只注射器连接于三向活塞，抽吸混合使注射液乳化。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.79,
            0.886,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 检查乳化效果: 取一滴混合液置于水上, 液滴悬浮并不分散就表示乳化成功。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.812,
            0.62,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乳液注射于小鼠的尾部及颈部背皮下。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.845,
            0.317,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（三）血液检测"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.88,
            0.899,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "免疫的效果可通过血清学检测，如抗体未生成或抗体滴度很低，则需要进行再次免"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 7,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.057,
            0.19,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "196"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.056,
            0.599,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.091,
            0.889,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "疫。一般从小鼠尾部侧边静脉采血，取血量控制为动物体重的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 以内，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 \\sim 200 \\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.113,
            0.909,
            0.154
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注意:如需采集大量血液样品，可在处死免疫小鼠取脾脏时同时进行，小鼠血清抗体可作为后续单克隆抗体检测实验的阳性对照。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.165,
            0.421,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（四）骨髓瘤细胞的准备"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.198,
            0.694,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在细胞融合步骤之前，提前约1周的时间将细胞解冻复苏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.219,
            0.634,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "骨髓瘤细胞必须已知种系来源，应避免支原体污染。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.251,
            0.377,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（五）细胞复苏培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.284,
            0.911,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）将细胞转移至24孔培养板，细胞浓度大约 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\times10^{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个/孔，每天进行细胞记数，当细胞数量翻倍时，转移至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25cm^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养瓶扩大培养，之后再转移至含有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50ml^{+}RF10"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "80cm^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养瓶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.348,
            0.912,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）在扩大培养的阶段要保持旺盛的生长速率。在融合的前一天，需要对骨髓瘤细胞进行一对一分裂，以使其在融合时处于指数生长期。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.39,
            0.913,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 骨髓瘤细胞的数量取决于脾细胞的量。典型的融合比例是脾细胞:骨髓瘤细胞为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10: 1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。一般每只 BALB/c 小鼠的脾脏可产生 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{8}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个白细胞，因此一只脾脏需对应 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{7}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个骨髓瘤细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.454,
            0.913,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）在融合当天，处死动物之前，还需认真检查骨髓瘤细胞，确认培养物没有受到污染。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.507,
            0.378,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（六）细胞融合实验"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.539,
            0.248,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.561,
            0.914,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) RF10 培养基:在 500ml RPMI 1640 中加入 50ml FBS 和 5ml 100×PSG。在 4℃保存（14 天以内），14 天后需更换 PSG，使用前 37℃水浴加热。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.604,
            0.915,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）HAT 选择培养基:将  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 \\times HAT"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  冻干添加剂溶于 10ml 无菌水中，分装每管 1ml， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  避光保存。在 100ml RF10 培养基中加入 1ml HAT 和 2ml HFCS。使用前  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  水浴保持恒温。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.667,
            0.915,
            0.707
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) HT 培养基:在 500ml RF10 培养基中加入 5ml HT。在使用之前 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水浴加热。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.71,
            0.915,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) HT 培养基 +2% HFCS: 在 100ml HT 培养基中加入 2ml HFCS。在使用之前 37℃ 水浴加热。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.753,
            0.917,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "HAT 培养基用于融合之后杂种细胞的筛选。氨基蝶呤（A）成分通过阻断 DNA 生物合成的主要途径，将未融合的骨髓瘤细胞与同种融合的骨髓瘤细胞筛选剔除。未融合的脾细胞在培养过程中缺乏生存能力，几天之后会自行死亡。而融合的杂种细胞，可利用次黄嘌呤（H）和胸苷（T），通过补救途径合成 DNA。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.838,
            0.917,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在选择压力下细胞通常需要添加某些特殊物质来维持生长。在一些单克隆抗体制备方案中，这些物质由饲喂细胞提供，通常采用小鼠胸腺细胞或者腹膜冲洗下来的细胞。本实验中，用 HFCS 代替饲喂细胞的作用，使用更为方便、有效及人道。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
